    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Misir monjo Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tekin Rehobowam loko dhum pere m'ocwiny paka kere, go kodi ji jojwango cik pa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I oro mar'abic ma dhum pa Rehobowam, kwoŋbedo oyido jokitim adieri ri Rwoth, Sisak kere ma Misir obino to monjo Yerusalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gi jolweny cawilin 1,200 kodi cwo 60,000 ma jogweyo kayinin. Jolweny ma kikwanere jobino gi Sisak wok i Misir, Libia, Sukim kodi Ethopiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisak omako tindin madongo m'otinda ma Yuda aka obino tundo kiri Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Semaya jatuci wac were obino bongi Rehobowam kodi jodhum ma Yuda, m'oyido jocokere i Yerusalem kwalok kwoŋ Sisak, aka owaco rijo ni, “Me apaka Rwoth waco, ‘Wijwangan, ameno nyo atieko jwango win i cingi Sisak.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo jodhum ma Isiraili kodi kere jomwole to jowaco ni, “Rwoth otire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Rwoth oneno nike jomwole, wac pa Rwoth obino kendo ri Semaya ni, “Jotieko mwole; aka ak'orey woko jo, to alabotho mogo kwoŋ jo, aka akilakonjo keme paran kwoŋ Yerusalem gi cingi Sisak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kad'ameno jobino bedo ŋecin pere, ŋey jowonyal ŋeyo rapok i dier tiyo ran kodi tiyo ri jodhum ma piny.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
