            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.16+1KI.10.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kerin 10:16-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.15+2CH.9.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kigana 9:15-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Sisak kere ma Misir obino to monjo Yerusalem; okwanyo lim je ma Ot pa Were kodi ŋaŋo ma ot pa kere; to kwanyo kisi gimoro. Go bende okwanyo kwote ma zahabu ma Solomon oyido otimo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka kere Rehobowam otimo kwote man gi ywel culo waŋ m'oyido otim gi zahabu aka omiyo jotel pa jokur ma waŋkac pa kere kuro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka noknok ka kere okidho i Ot pa Rwoth, jakur oyido bino to tiŋo kwote, aka rumacen dwoko i kisika m'ikan'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kwoŋbedo Rehobowam omwole, Rwoth k'oreyo jo woko kicutho i keme pere; aka gigipiny okadho maber ri Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tho pa Rehobowam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Rehobowam odhumo i Yerusalem to medo dwoŋ pere paka kere. Go oyido jaoro piero aŋwen g'acel munyo cako dhum, aka odhumo ma oro apar g'abirio i Yerusalem, tindi madwoŋ ma Rwoth oyido oyero kwoŋ nonin je ma Isiraili paka kabedo m'iripo lam'iye go. Yok Rehobowam oyido ilwoŋo ni Nama ma wok i Amon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehobowam otimo gimarac, kole go k'oketho cunye i rango mito pa Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo tim pa Rehobowam, wok i cakirok tundo i gike ondiki i Kigana pa Semaya kodi Ido jotuci wac Were. Lweny obedo ma kicoki i dier Rehobowam kodi Yerobowam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehobowam otho aka oyiki go kam'oyik'iye bacere pere i tindi madwoŋ pa Daudi; aka wode m'ilwoŋo ni Abija olunjo go paka kere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
